  - name: Longmont 2021 GHG Inventory (30 Jan 2023)
    authority: City of Longmont (inventory workbook created by Julia Ferguson)
    url:
    description: 'The 2021 community inventory, with years back to 2016 on the Year
      over Year sheet. Origin of the historical sector emissions (Year over Year),
      the GWPs, the waste emission factors, the transit share and the 2021-era fuel
      and vehicle factors. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is when
      the file was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. A second
      copy with the same name but different bytes is at the top of the Drive folder
      (saved 2023-02-10). Years covered: 2016-2021.; Attachment: client/Longmont (CO)
      Client/KP material/FINAL_Longmont_2021_GHG_Inventory_01302023.xlsx; Format:
      .xlsx; Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2023-03-16;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Longmont 2024 GHG Inventory (city original, March 2025)
    authority: City of Longmont (last saved by Francie Jaffe, 2025-03-25)
    url:
    description: "The 2024 community inventory as it was on the city's SharePoint,
      without the sheets added later for Paths. It is the original for the 2024 values:
      stationary energy, aviation, transit, railways, waste and recycling, IPPU and
      the GWPs. Sent by Francie Jaffe (City of Longmont); the date is when the file
      was last saved, which approximates when Kausal received it. Years covered: 2016-2024.;
      Attachment: client/Longmont (CO) Client/2025 Paths Update/From Longmont_s Sharepoint
      Folder 020242025/DATA COLLECTION_Longmont_2024_GHG_Inventory.xlsx; Format: .xlsx;
      Geographic Coverage: City of Longmont, Colorado; Date Last Updated: 2025-03-25;
      Updated by: Jouni Tuomisto (register row drafted by Claude, 2026-11-21)"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  dataset:
